### Smart Loan Tracker API - Notification Endpoints
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api
@authToken = your-auth-token-here
@notificationId = notification-id-here

### Get All Notifications
GET {{baseUrl}}/notifications
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Get All Notifications - With Limit
GET {{baseUrl}}/notifications?limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Get Unread Notification Count
GET {{baseUrl}}/notifications/unread-count
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Mark Notification as Read
POST {{baseUrl}}/notifications/mark-read
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "notificationId": "{{notificationId}}"
}

